  author-generated model artifacts   Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Data artifacts are under CC-BY-4.0: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

That covers the fitted operator dictionaries and the small tables in derived/,
as well as the fitted dictionaries, coefficient arrays and fit records in the
companion model-output archive.

This licence does not cover the two public source datasets or repackaged
coordinate data derived from them. The release therefore directs users to the
CalMS21 record (CaltechDATA 10.22002/D1.1991) and the keypoint-MoSeq open-field
record (Zenodo 15171335) rather than redistributing those files. See
docs/DATA_AVAILABILITY.md.
